00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:32.060
Oh, they're both gone.

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:51.820
Gone? They're gone.

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:55.360
Where could they have gone to fight, Master Pogi?

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:10.510
It's impossible. They're really fast at fighting each other.

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:29.770
That's not bad, Sankoko.

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:34.150
I never thought I'd regret this in my fight with you today.

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:36.400
Me too.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:39.000
This is how you should always fight.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:44.660
Get ready.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:45.840
They're here!

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:51.200
What?

00:06:52.630 --> 00:06:55.110
They're hiding in their part of the ring

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:57.770
