00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:04.450
Ah, I see. Now I know.

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:09.680
I don't think I can fool people like him, Waisto.

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:12.050
You're really good, Master Pogi.

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:15.020
You're really our only champion and our only hope.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:32.070
They're standing there.

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:33.820
Huh? Huh?

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:42.190
They're standing there, Master Poggy.

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:48.250
Ganjarit! They're standing there!

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:49.270
Huh? Easy!

00:08:04.570 --> 00:08:05.790
What's happening to what they're showing?

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:08.220
Are they out of their minds now?

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:11.500
