00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:49.140
That's where Master Kami died, in that place, so he can say what's happening in the world.

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:58.680
Yes, you don't need to make yourself easy.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:05.680
Our boss here got used to it before he could handle everything that was happening on Earth.

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:08.500
Just relax.

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:14.200
Concentrate until you hear the smallest sound you can hear.

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:24.080
Goku is fighting now.

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:26.070
Don't let them get away.

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:29.770
That's right.

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:30.250
Go.

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:33.330
Laban pa-pa-pa.

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:13.160
This is a very good match.

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:17.800
It's a waste if you lose just because you fell out of our ring.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:22.720
We should just forget about the past.

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:26.620
It will only ruin the beauty of our match.

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:34.670
