00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:45.390
I think they're doing this for the good of the people around them.

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:48.060
Huh? Huh? Huh?

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:54.770
Thank you so much, mister!

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:58.490
It would be better if all of you just went home.

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:00.260
Let's go.

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:05.040
We can't go back.

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:06.390
Can we, Ikang?

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:11.120
Our idol, Master Pogi, is going to fight after that one.

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:13.690
Am I right, Master Pogi?

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:18.280
