00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:28.040
I want to watch something good.

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:46.340
Our ring is now a desert land.

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:50.950
One of us will win if the enemy surrenders or retreats.

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:54.660
Is that so? A fight until the end?

00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:57.960
I think that kind of fight suits us better.

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:00.400
It's fine.

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:08.480
Now, I will use this big ring so that it won't be a waste.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:09.000
Huh?

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:25.920
