00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.120
E-sir! E-sir!

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:38.140
There's no problem.

00:14:58.140 --> 00:14:59.420
They don't have anything to use.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.200
We have a strong man there, so just wait.

00:15:02.680 --> 00:15:04.790
Of course! Of course!

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:06.210
Just a little patience!

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:12.700
He's so stubborn!

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:34.400
That's quite a feat.

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:35.300
Huh?

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:36.580
What's that?

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:38.420
In your opinion, Master, is that handsome?

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:40.790
Ugh, I'm tired.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:42.800
A

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:44.160
BANDARAYA

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:45.780
MADAYA

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:28.780
Did you still get all of what's happening here?

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:47.570
Because the two of them are not only fast, their strengths are the same.

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:32.210
Heheheheh

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:33.340
Hindeee

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:34.420
Heeeh

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:35.200
Waktan

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:35.760
Heeeh

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:41.590
Higulpehimo

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:42.600
Sige pa! Sige pa!

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:43.450
Sige!

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:45.430
Sige!

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:45.590
Sige!

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:46.310
Ganyan! Ganyan!

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:47.770
Hindi pwede!

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:49.880
Kayang kayang ang ilaga ni Goku!

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:51.260
Heheheheh

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:53.970
Sige lang! Sige pa!

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:54.610
Sige!

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:55.480
Sige!

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:56.920
Sige pa!

00:17:57.520 --> 00:17:58.000
Sige!

00:17:58.280 --> 00:17:58.900
Heheheheh

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.000
Come on! Come on!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:02.520
Come on!

00:18:06.590 --> 00:18:10.040
Their fight is too intense and they're not tired at all.

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:12.780
They've been fighting for a long time,

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:16.600
but their strength hasn't decreased since they started fighting.

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:20.480
Cell is really strong, but Son Goku is also very strong.

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:05.300
Goku! Looks like he's preparing a surprise for Cell!

00:19:09.090 --> 00:19:09.570
Kame...

00:19:12.220 --> 00:19:12.880
Kamehame Wave!

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:17.130
I think Goku will use the power of the Kamehame Wave to go down here!

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:29.270
You won't be able to use the Kamehame Wave that came from there!

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.200
If you do that, you'll destroy the Titanic!

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:38.070
Goku won't do that, because he won't allow the world to be destroyed

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:40.050
so that he can win this battle.

00:19:41.760 --> 00:19:42.400
Here!

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:54.930
Keep going!

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:04.090
I won't let you get away with this!

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:25.220
At the end, I used the Kamehame Wave of all my strength and strength.

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:29.520
It is in the hands of San Goku now that I will take care of him.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:30.500
Thank you.

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:04.510
There! It's Goku!

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:04.970
Huh?

00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:16.460
He's...

00:22:17.280 --> 00:22:17.560
He's...

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:18.580
He's so strong!

00:22:19.060 --> 00:22:20.440
What's happening to them there?

00:22:41.580 --> 00:22:43.050
He won! He did it!

00:22:43.390 --> 00:22:46.590
I thought Goku wouldn't be able to fight Cell.

00:22:46.910 --> 00:22:48.870
He won! Did you hear that?

00:22:48.990 --> 00:22:50.260
Goku won!

00:23:01.660 --> 00:23:04.210
Why? What's the problem? Aren't you guys happy?

00:23:04.590 --> 00:23:08.600
Uh, Master Pogi, it looks like he's the one who won this battle.

00:23:09.060 --> 00:23:20.920
Oh, of course! I'm really good at that one.

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:24.400
But I feel sorry for him because I want him to be a few steps ahead of me.

00:23:24.620 --> 00:23:25.340
I can't do it!

00:23:26.130 --> 00:23:26.350
Hahaha!

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:29.870
He's really feeling sorry for himself and he hasn't experienced the world yet.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:32.660
