00:23:33.420 --> 00:23:36.060
in the real martial arts arena, isn't it?

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:37.360
Yes, it is.

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:42.210
Dear fans, I'm sad to say that before Master Pogi came out

00:23:42.210 --> 00:23:45.430
to show us his amazing techniques,

00:23:45.670 --> 00:23:48.440
he was defeated by a man you don't know, Sel.

00:23:49.150 --> 00:23:57.760
That's good.

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:01.320
At last, the fight is over.

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:04.560
