00:24:04.800 --> 00:24:10.070
I don't think so, son.

00:24:10.230 --> 00:24:19.730
What does this mean?

00:24:20.170 --> 00:24:24.490
There's still a lot of power left in his body,

00:24:24.570 --> 00:24:26.440
even in his current state.

00:24:27.440 --> 00:24:29.680
Huh? Be careful!

00:24:31.790 --> 00:24:33.750
Maybe Sel's body is back to its original form!

00:24:34.130 --> 00:24:34.470
What?

00:24:35.000 --> 00:24:35.360
Huh?

00:24:35.760 --> 00:24:47.240
What happened?

00:24:47.820 --> 00:24:50.080
Sel's body is back to its original form!

00:25:17.630 --> 00:25:18.770
And Sel is finally alive!

00:25:20.210 --> 00:25:23.450
Is this the same Pandaraya you were talking about, Master Pogi?

00:25:24.250 --> 00:25:26.850
Of course! That's the light of my dream!

00:25:31.240 --> 00:25:38.290
You still managed to bring back the damaged part of your body.

00:25:38.610 --> 00:25:41.120
Good thing you know, Piccolo is just like me.

00:25:42.040 --> 00:25:43.180
You're not happy?

00:25:43.940 --> 00:25:49.220
That's why I wondered why my victory was so easy.

00:25:49.340 --> 00:25:52.720
But it looks like your strength has decreased and you're not like you were before.

00:25:53.340 --> 00:25:56.460
We're both weak, Son Goku.

00:25:58.340 --> 00:25:59.880
You're also getting weaker, Justo.

00:26:00.510 --> 00:26:03.870
Let's continue the fight, but I just want you to know that I can't afford to lose.

00:26:04.310 --> 00:26:06.700
Your tactics are twice as good.

00:26:06.800 --> 00:26:09.000
So don't waste your remaining strength.

00:26:09.380 --> 00:26:10.400
I know!

00:26:10.740 --> 00:26:11.160
Really?

00:26:31.980 --> 00:26:32.020
Ugh!

00:26:33.560 --> 00:26:33.660
Ugh!

00:26:33.720 --> 00:26:52.940
You can't fight this anymore!

00:26:52.940 --> 00:26:54.100
Zero doesn't stop attacking!

00:26:54.900 --> 00:26:56.480
You're just not a man anymore!

00:27:11.200 --> 00:27:13.320
Even though we're standing here, it's already getting dark.

00:27:13.860 --> 00:27:17.420
We can't tell what will happen next, my friends.

00:27:18.360 --> 00:27:19.930
Oh, it's Goku.

00:27:20.530 --> 00:27:22.380
Why is he like that?

00:27:26.350 --> 00:27:26.910
Oh, oh.

00:27:27.070 --> 00:27:28.320
Go on, Bulma.

00:27:28.540 --> 00:27:29.970
The fight is...

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:35.120
I came here because it's better to have someone with me who understands martial arts than to watch me alone.

00:27:36.770 --> 00:27:41.990
Oh my baby, what does my baby want?

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:34.830
But they can still fight this strong and fast.

00:29:13.760 --> 00:29:14.800
What's your problem, Goku?

00:29:15.080 --> 00:29:15.690
You don't want to?

00:29:15.970 --> 00:29:17.490
You're smart!

00:29:57.770 --> 00:29:59.370
Go ahead, Goku! Don't stop!

00:30:34.320 --> 00:30:35.100
You're so good, Goku!

00:30:35.360 --> 00:30:38.260
You're just getting there, and you'll be able to defeat that beast, Cell!

00:30:40.170 --> 00:30:44.150
Okay, let's do this!

00:30:47.200 --> 00:30:50.200
This is the end of Cell's unrecognizable power!

00:30:51.460 --> 00:30:55.850
Cell is really stopping now because he's drowning in the thick smoke!

00:30:57.040 --> 00:30:59.420
I swear, you won't see this fight on TV!

00:31:00.090 --> 00:31:00.530
That's because you're drunk!

00:31:00.850 --> 00:31:02.820
You're a jerk!

00:31:03.540 --> 00:31:04.730
You can't be seen on TV!

00:31:04.890 --> 00:31:05.090
What do you think?

00:31:08.010 --> 00:31:08.790
Our equipment is not broken!

00:31:10.170 --> 00:31:13.610
They really did not allow their boys to be brought into the field!

00:31:14.770 --> 00:31:15.250
Hey!

00:31:18.240 --> 00:31:19.940
All of you, listen to us!

00:31:21.580 --> 00:31:21.680
Yeah!

00:31:21.840 --> 00:31:29.750
You can do it!

00:31:30.380 --> 00:31:31.280
Gingin lang Goku

00:31:31.280 --> 00:31:32.710
Alles na

00:31:36.540 --> 00:31:37.100
Galing

00:32:25.084 --> 00:32:27.084
is John Master Poggy.

00:32:28.700 --> 00:32:29.980
Oh, it's not cool!

00:32:30.030 --> 00:32:32.330
I'm just warming up here for my match later.

00:32:32.550 --> 00:32:33.230
I'll be right back.

00:32:34.570 --> 00:32:37.310
You're really the World Champion, Master Pogi!

00:32:37.650 --> 00:32:40.910
You're always ready to fight, no matter what the situation is.

00:32:40.950 --> 00:32:43.270
And you're doing a different kind of warm-up right now.

00:32:44.340 --> 00:32:46.800
Of course! I'll be right back!

00:32:46.800 --> 00:32:47.780
Oh my! Oh my!

00:32:48.360 --> 00:32:52.880
And your microphone won't be able to stop you no matter what happens here.

00:32:53.680 --> 00:32:58.430
But Igan, what is this big ball that is now circling Sel?

00:33:17.400 --> 00:33:22.160
The more you attack, the more I need to defend myself in this war.

00:33:22.800 --> 00:33:26.480
Your plan is more dangerous than I thought.

00:33:32.940 --> 00:33:34.080
What kind of scene is that?

00:33:34.580 --> 00:33:38.180
Yeah, I can't understand what's going on.

00:33:38.240 --> 00:33:39.220
It's too simple.

00:33:39.860 --> 00:33:50.340
Hey, I'm not mistaken.

00:33:50.800 --> 00:33:53.720
The guy is Chi-Chi's husband and he's right there in the other house.

00:33:54.040 --> 00:33:57.740
I heard that he dyed his hair and even his son is a man.

00:33:58.690 --> 00:33:59.030
Huh?

00:34:00.600 --> 00:34:02.030
Yeah, that's what you look like.

00:34:02.750 --> 00:34:06.690
If you notice, he always wears that kind of clothes.

00:34:07.660 --> 00:34:11.710
It doesn't hurt!

00:34:14.570 --> 00:34:24.580
No, it's just a scratch.

00:34:25.260 --> 00:34:29.070
You know, Goku looks like he's fighting alongside me.

00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:33.600
But it's not like Gokul. Sel is smart and has confidence.

00:34:34.280 --> 00:34:36.280
What? I don't think so.

00:34:37.500 --> 00:34:40.970
I'm just sad to tell you this, but...

00:34:41.540 --> 00:34:46.840
Gokul can't beat Sel and it looks like Gokul is feeling it too, Bulma.

00:34:47.020 --> 00:34:50.900
I don't know what he's thinking.

00:35:19.200 --> 00:35:23.180
Goku's strength is just as strong as Cell's.

00:35:23.220 --> 00:35:24.850
But Goku is faster than Cell.

00:35:32.140 --> 00:35:35.630
It looks like there's a lot of energy in you, Son Goku.

00:35:35.910 --> 00:35:41.110
Why don't you just eat some Magic Beans?

00:35:41.170 --> 00:35:43.600
This will make our fight even better.

00:35:44.540 --> 00:35:49.560
It's about time!

00:35:49.860 --> 00:35:54.120
