00:35:57.560 --> 00:35:59.610
That's right, Trunks! That's right, Discarte!

00:36:02.330 --> 00:36:03.310
Ririn, the magic beans!

00:36:05.540 --> 00:36:29.200
What are you waiting for?

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:31.580
Give the Magic Beans to Goku!

00:36:31.600 --> 00:36:33.360
Stop there, Trunks!

00:36:33.560 --> 00:36:33.660
Huh?

00:36:36.410 --> 00:36:38.310
Don't you have a choice as a Saiyan?

00:36:38.460 --> 00:36:39.980
Goku will choose the evil one

00:36:39.980 --> 00:36:42.690
instead of succeeding in this battle

00:36:42.690 --> 00:36:43.960
in a bad way.

00:36:47.360 --> 00:36:49.120
He's no longer fighting for the world

00:36:49.120 --> 00:36:51.120
but for his blood-thirsty master.

00:36:51.940 --> 00:36:53.560
Don't you ever forget that.

00:36:55.920 --> 00:36:58.580
But, Father, if Goku continues...

00:37:04.250 --> 00:37:05.410
There's nothing left for us to do.

00:37:05.710 --> 00:37:06.950
He's going to fall asleep.

00:37:10.210 --> 00:37:15.350
It's painful for me to say this,

00:37:15.450 --> 00:37:17.080
but I've also gotten used to it.

00:37:17.520 --> 00:37:18.460
And in this case,

00:37:18.780 --> 00:37:21.700
I've truly surpassed the powerful power of San Goku.

00:37:23.180 --> 00:37:24.000
San Goku is a smart man,

00:37:24.700 --> 00:37:29.030
but that Cell is much stronger than him.

00:37:30.350 --> 00:37:33.490
What are you trying to say, Father?

00:37:33.690 --> 00:37:36.040
Are we just going to sit here and watch?

00:37:36.840 --> 00:37:39.700
Didn't you tell me that he still has a secret plan

00:37:39.700 --> 00:37:41.880
that he can still do, Trunks?

00:37:42.020 --> 00:37:44.530
We should trust him.

00:37:53.830 --> 00:37:55.770
What's on your mind right now?

00:38:00.160 --> 00:38:05.860
What's the problem? Is your pride too high and you can't eat the Magic Beans?

00:38:05.980 --> 00:38:13.790
I'm out of strength now, so if you can just return your strength,

00:38:14.010 --> 00:38:20.090
you'll have a little hope to defeat me, so just follow my orders.

00:38:20.470 --> 00:38:29.610
I want to increase my pride in fighting.

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:31.240
Fight me now!

00:39:09.920 --> 00:39:10.660
We won, Sel!

00:39:10.800 --> 00:39:16.190
Yes, I give up.

00:39:16.510 --> 00:39:19.270
I already know how strong you are, Sel.

00:39:19.350 --> 00:39:22.210
That's why I have no reason to continue our fight.

00:39:22.790 --> 00:39:29.140
He said, he's gone!

00:39:30.000 --> 00:39:31.380
Why, Goku?

00:39:31.660 --> 00:39:32.000
What?

00:39:32.410 --> 00:39:33.140
San Goku is giving up?

00:39:34.970 --> 00:39:37.350
He's never given up before!

00:39:37.710 --> 00:39:38.330
Why?

00:39:38.950 --> 00:39:40.350
Why, Papa?

00:39:42.150 --> 00:39:44.710
What's on his mind right now?

00:39:48.180 --> 00:39:56.340
When Goku comes to the fight, he'll give up!

00:40:03.740 --> 00:40:05.120
and was defeated by Sengoku.

00:40:05.320 --> 00:40:11.440
What will happen to Earth now?
